{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45063","headline":"奉陪陆使君长源诸公游支硎寺 · 皎然","name":"奉陪陆使君长源诸公游支硎寺","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"尝览高逸传，山僧有遗踪。\n佐游继雅篇，嘉会何繇逢。\n尘世即下界，色天当上峰。\n春晖徧衆草，寒色留高松。\n缭绕彩云合，参差绮楼重。\n琼葩洒巾舃，石瀃清心胸。\n灵境若可托，道情知所从。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皎然","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_45063.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45063","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}